  "title": "SOC testing workpaper",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>SOC testing workpaper</h2><p>Evaluate the adequacy of four proposed testing conclusions.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f1\">Improve test A</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f1\"><option value=\"Obtain appropriate corroborating operating evidence\">Obtain appropriate corroborating operating evidence</option><option value=\"Rely only on the policy title\">Rely only on the policy title</option><option value=\"Remove the control objective\">Remove the control objective</option><option value=\"Assume all monthly controls work\">Assume all monthly controls work</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f2\">Improve test B</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f2\"><option value=\"Use the relevant administrator-access population\">Use the relevant administrator-access population</option><option value=\"Increase only the ordinary-user sample\">Increase only the ordinary-user sample</option><option value=\"Ignore administrators\">Ignore administrators</option><option value=\"Sample unrelated invoices\">Sample unrelated invoices</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f3\">Improve test C</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f3\"><option value=\"Retain, investigate, and evaluate the deviation\">Retain, investigate, and evaluate the deviation</option><option value=\"Delete all exceptions\">Delete all exceptions</option><option value=\"Count only favorable evidence\">Count only favorable evidence</option><option value=\"Assume every deviation is harmless\">Assume every deviation is harmless</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f4\">Improve test D</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Investigate the unsupported quarter and assess significance\">Investigate the unsupported quarter and assess significance</option><option value=\"Claim four supported reviews\">Claim four supported reviews</option><option value=\"Assume signatures are unnecessary in every case\">Assume signatures are unnecessary in every case</option><option value=\"Ignore the report period\">Ignore the report period</option></select></div></section>",
