      "title": "Testing observations",
      "html": "<p>A: Inquiry alone is used to conclude a monthly reconciliation operated all year. B: Administrator access is tested using only ordinary-user requests. C: One deviation is removed from the results without investigation. D: A quarterly review has support for three quarters only.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "isc-m3-tbs4-ex2",
      "title": "Objective",
      "html": "<p>Obtain sufficient appropriate evidence about the described controls over the report period.</p>"
    }
