  "explanation": "<h3>Improve test A</h3><p>Inquiry alone does not ordinarily establish period-long effectiveness.</p><h3>Improve test B</h3><p>The population must match the control.</p><h3>Improve test C</h3><p>Deviations form part of the evidence and conclusion.</p><h3>Improve test D</h3><p>The missing quarter needs an evidence-based evaluation.</p>"
